sness, stress handling, technical, but nasty remarks is serious for crew cooperation. Candidate A has egocentric and communication issues. Candidate C has show-off and not open to new ideas. Candidate D has hot temper and know-it-all.\n\nWhich concern is most severe? Crew cooperation is critical. Nasty remarks may be severe. Show-off also problematic. Hot temper also severe. Egocentric also problematic.\n\nMaybe Candidate B's negative behavior is more severe than others? All have issues. Need to weigh.\n\nWe could ask other agents for missing info, like about candidate's crew cooperation or adaptability. But we can make an initial contribution, maybe propose Candidate B as provisional, but note concerns.\n\nWe need to reference existing discussion (none). We can say \"I will start by focusing on Candidate B\". Provide evidence and recommendation.\n\nVote must be one candidate. Let's vote Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
